    "body": "**Decision needed:** five proposals are waiting on you and nothing gets built until one has the `approved` label. With the Costa Rica trip starting **Jan 4** (~11 weeks), order matters.\n\n**My recommended order (default if I don't hear otherwise — I'll keep proposing, not building):**\n\n1. **#13 Card-free hosting** — everything else is only useful on the trip if it's reachable from your phone; hosting has the longest lead time (accounts you set up, cron, testing on mobile).\n2. **#8 Sourcing CRM v1** — suppliers/contacts/follow-ups; the base #9 and #10 hang off.\n3. **#10 Field mode** — offline visit & cupping log; needs #8's supplier records.\n4. **#9 Offer check** — FX/farmgate data sources now confirmed free ([research note](https://github.com/zack-hum/coffee-intelligence-v1.1/blob/docs/research-2026-10-15/agent/research/2026-10-17-free-fx-and-icafe-price-sources.md), PR #12).\n5. **#11 STRATEGY.md draft** — docs only; can go anytime.\n\nMain alternative I rejected: building #10 Field mode first — it's the most trip-specific, but without hosting and supplier records it would be a standalone notebook you'd have to re-enter later.\n\n**How to answer:** add `approved` to #13 (and any others you're happy with), or comment here with a different order. Also worth merging #7 (workflow docs) and #12 (research notes) — both green.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
